== Introduction ==

This is a sample '''MediaWiki''' markup file demonstrating common wikitext features.
MediaWiki is the software that powers [[Wikipedia]] and thousands of other wikis.

'''Bold text''' and ''italic text'' are common formatting options.
You can also combine them: '''''bold italic'''''.

